# 5. Legal Basis for Processing

Depending on the applicable law and circumstances, information may be processed because it is necessary to:

* Provide the requested Bot functionality
* Perform actions requested by users or server administrators
* Maintain the integrity and security of the service
* Comply with applicable legal obligations
* Protect the rights, property, and security of the service and its users
* Pursue legitimate interests where permitted by applicable law

Where applicable law requires consent or another specific legal basis, processing will be handled according to those requirements.

This Privacy Policy does not attempt to determine which legal basis applies to every individual user or jurisdiction.

